#: ../../HANDLERS.md:34 2d74b62edee447858b9bf74e214f936d
msgid ""
"There is one thing that is not a frame at all: `GET /healthz` answers "
"over plain HTTP, for a proxy or an orchestrator that cannot speak this "
"protocol. See [Liveness](#liveness)."
msgstr "有一樣東西根本不是訊框：`GET /healthz` 透過一般 HTTP 回覆，給不會講這個協定的代理伺服器或編排器使用。見[存活檢查](#liveness)。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:38 194145b740424144afca9312256f7175
msgid ""
"`hello` needs no session: what the build can price is a property of the "
"service, and a client has to be able to ask before it opens one. The "
"reply carries **sets** — the styles, methods, trees, approximations, "
"result kinds, market shapes and leg kinds this build implements — and "
"deliberately not the combinations: whether an analytic barrier takes an "
"American exercise is a rule about a pair, and there are more pairs than "
"are worth putting on the wire. What the handshake removes is the drift "
"that actually happens, which is a value entering or leaving one of these "
"lists while every client's copy of this page says otherwise. "
"`src/session/capabilities.cpp` is where the lists live, next to the "
"dispatch they describe."
msgstr "`hello` 不需要工作階段：這個建置能為什麼計價是服務本身的屬性，用戶端必須能在開啟工作階段之前就先問。回覆帶的是**集合**——這個建置實作的類型、方法、樹、近似法、結果種類、市場形狀與交易腳種類——而刻意不帶組合：解析解障礙能否接受美式履約，是關於一對值的規則，而這樣的配對多到不值得放上線路。這次握手消除的是真正會發生的漂移，也就是某個值被加進或移出這些清單，而每個用戶端手上的這一頁卻還寫著另一回事。這些清單放在 `src/session/capabilities.cpp`，就在它們所描述的分派邏輯旁邊。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:49 e029d60062f9491d825ab671d98aea62
msgid ""
"`Progress` is the one non-terminal frame. Three shapes emit it: a batched"
" Monte Carlo (`engine.mc.progress_every_paths`), a scenario sweep, and a "
"batch. Those are also the three that can be stopped where they stand — "
"see [Cancellation](#cancellation)."
msgstr "`Progress` 是唯一的非終結訊框。會送出它的有三種形狀：分批的蒙地卡羅（`engine.mc.progress_every_paths`）、情境掃描，以及批次。這三種也正是能在原地停下的——見[取消](#cancellation)。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:54 8ac68b37c2db4c578123a02ffbbbacd8
msgid ""
"Every frame carries `request_id` (yours, echoed on every reply) and "
"`session_id` (set on every server frame, because one socket can hold "
"several sessions)."
msgstr "每個訊框都帶著 `request_id`（由你配發，每個回覆都會回傳）與 `session_id`（每個伺服器訊框都會設定，因為一條連線可以持有好幾個工作階段）。"

