#: ../../HANDLERS.md:177 c31753a1928347cf927845ef5a1e7659
msgid ""
"`FAMILY_IBOR` and `FAMILY_OVERNIGHT` build. `SWAP`, `INFLATION_ZERO` and "
"`INFLATION_YOY` are `UNSUPPORTED`. `name` is required — the service "
"builds the index from the conventions you send rather than looking it up "
"in a table of hardcoded indices, because that table is what goes stale."
msgstr "`FAMILY_IBOR` 與 `FAMILY_OVERNIGHT` 可以建構。`SWAP`、`INFLATION_ZERO` 與 `INFLATION_YOY` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`。`name` 為必填——服務依照你送來的慣例建構利率指標，而不是去一張寫死的指標表裡查，因為會過時的正是那張表。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:182 f6364a66c8b442ec8d2905a889a14e7b
msgid ""
"`FixingSeries` may arrive in `OpenSession` or in `UpdateMarket`: past "
"fixings are graph input, not graph structure, so a leg that cannot price "
"without one does not need a new session to get it."
msgstr "`FixingSeries` 可以在 `OpenSession` 或 `UpdateMarket` 中送達：過去的定盤值是物件圖的輸入，不是物件圖的結構，所以缺了定盤值就無法計價的交易腳，不需要開新的工作階段才能拿到它。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:186 b33133fbcc744a328a27c9c13e468180
msgid "Correlation matrices"
msgstr "相關係數矩陣"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:188 cf11cdbbf0374372b89846379a6f0fb2
msgid ""
"`labels` names the rows and columns, and an `Underlying.label` is what "
"finds a row; `values` is row-major, `labels²` entries, each a `Number` so"
" an off-diagonal can be a live `quote_id` and drag like anything else in "
"the quote bar. The diagonal must be exactly 1, the matrix symmetric, "
"every entry within [-1, 1] and the whole thing positive semi-definite."
msgstr "`labels` 為列與欄命名，而 `Underlying.label` 就是用來找到某一列的依據；`values` 以列為主排列，共 `labels²` 個元素，每個都是 `Number`，所以非對角元素可以是即時的 `quote_id`，並像報價列上的其他東西一樣拖動。對角線必須恰好為 1，矩陣必須對稱，每個元素都在 [-1, 1] 之內，而整個矩陣必須是半正定的。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:194 08f284937b974156a809316266d1ae9f
msgid ""
"All four are checked **when the object is built and again on every "
"request that uses it**, because the entries are quotes: a matrix that was"
" a correlation matrix when the session opened can be dragged into one "
"that is not. This is the one market object where QuantLib would not have "
"complained. `StulzEngine` takes rho as a bare `Real`; "
"`StochasticProcessArray` factorises with `SalvagingAlgorithm::Spectral`, "
"which *repairs* a matrix that is not positive semi-definite by zeroing "
"the negative eigenvalues and renormalising. An impossible market is "
"therefore neither refused nor mispriced — it is silently replaced by the "
"nearest possible one and priced correctly for that."
msgstr "這四項**在物件建構時檢查，每個用到它的請求也會再檢查一次**，因為元素都是報價：工作階段開啟時還是相關係數矩陣的矩陣，可能被拖成不是的樣子。這是唯一一個 QuantLib 本身不會抱怨的市場物件。`StulzEngine` 把 rho 當成單純的 `Real`；`StochasticProcessArray` 則以 `SalvagingAlgorithm::Spectral` 分解，它會把負的特徵值歸零再重新正規化，藉此*修補*不是半正定的矩陣。因此一個不可能存在的市場既不會被拒絕，也不會被算錯價——它會被無聲地換成最接近的可能市場，並針對那個市場正確計價。"

