#: ../../HANDLERS.md:229 0323c2e4b872417d8c2552745cffa140
msgid "Style-specific rules worth knowing before you send one:"
msgstr "送出之前值得先知道的各類型專屬規則："

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:231 9df775b501b247109fbf2ed9fdc9db44
msgid ""
"**Barrier.** `ANALYTIC` is European only and takes a `plain` payoff; an "
"American barrier goes to `LATTICE` or `FINITE_DIFFERENCE`. The barrier "
"lattice is **Cox-Ross-Rubinstein only** (with the Derman-Kani correction)"
" — the engine takes a second template argument for the discretisation, so"
" a full menu would be trees × discretisations. `monitoring_dates` and "
"`window_start` are `UNSUPPORTED`: discrete and partial-time barriers are "
"not built."
msgstr "**障礙。**`ANALYTIC` 僅限歐式，且只接受 `plain` 收益函數；美式障礙要走 `LATTICE` 或 `FINITE_DIFFERENCE`。障礙格點**僅支援 Cox-Ross-Rubinstein**（含 Derman-Kani 修正）——該引擎的第二個樣板參數是離散化方式，所以完整選單會變成樹 × 離散化。`monitoring_dates` 與 `window_start` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`：離散觀察與部分期間障礙沒有實作。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:238 416715e447e6463286da91692f809849
msgid ""
"**Double barrier.** Needs `0 < lower < upper`. `ANALYTIC` only — "
"QuantLib's sole FD double-barrier engine is Heston, which takes a "
"calibrated model rather than a process."
msgstr "**雙障礙。**需要 `0 < lower < upper`。僅限 `ANALYTIC`——QuantLib 唯一的有限差分雙障礙引擎是 Heston，它吃的是校準過的模型，而不是過程。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:241 4243bd9f51f74e80a686f8de09ec1442
msgid ""
"**Forward start.** Send no strike: it is `moneyness` × the spot at "
"`reset`, filled in by the forward engine, and a struck payoff would be "
"silently overwritten. `performance` is a `Flag` — it pays the return "
"rather than the amount, a different price for the same trade description."
msgstr "**遠期起始。**不要送履約價：履約價是 `moneyness` × `reset` 時的現貨價，由遠期引擎填入，送了帶履約價的收益函數會被無聲覆寫。`performance` 是一個 `Flag`——它支付報酬率而非金額，同一段交易描述會得到不同的價格。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:245 8524a73fcb1940fab107804f6ca0a77c
msgid ""
"**Asian.** No `fixing_dates` means continuously averaged, which has a "
"closed form for the **geometric** average only. With fixing dates, "
"geometric goes to `ANALYTIC` and arithmetic to `MONTE_CARLO`."
msgstr "**亞式。**沒有 `fixing_dates` 代表連續平均，而連續平均只有**幾何**平均才有封閉解。有定盤日時，幾何平均走 `ANALYTIC`，算術平均走 `MONTE_CARLO`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:248 eb34a08421a547418b7c6759b49f204e
msgid ""
"**Lookback.** Continuous only; `window_start` is `UNSUPPORTED`. "
"`running_extremum` is required and must be positive — an option already "
"running whose extremum is dropped prices as if it had just started. A "
"`floating` payoff selects the floating-strike instrument."
msgstr "**回顧式。**僅限連續觀察；`window_start` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`。`running_extremum` 為必填且必須為正——一個已經在存續中、卻漏掉極值的選擇權，會被當成剛剛才開始那樣計價。`floating` 收益函數會選到浮動履約價的商品。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:252 1866da29ebbb4c8d9496de8514129a12
msgid ""
"**Knock digital.** A `barrier` carrying a `cash_or_nothing` or "
"`asset_or_nothing` payoff, priced by `AnalyticBinaryBarrierEngine`. It "
"takes `ANALYTIC`, an `AMERICAN` exercise with `payoff_at_expiry` "
"**true**, no `earliest_date` after the evaluation date, and **no rebate**"
" — the engine never reads one, so a rebate sent here would be taken and "
"dropped. The `digital` style arm is `UNSUPPORTED` and says this: its "
"three fields re-declare `Barrier.type`, `Barrier.level` and "
"`CashOrNothingPayoff.cash_payoff`, which the request already carries."
msgstr "**敲出入二元選擇權。**帶著 `cash_or_nothing` 或 `asset_or_nothing` 收益函數的 `barrier`，由 `AnalyticBinaryBarrierEngine` 計價。它接受 `ANALYTIC`、`payoff_at_expiry` 為 **true** 的 `AMERICAN` 履約、不得有晚於評價日的 `earliest_date`，而且**不接受回饋金**——引擎根本不會讀它，所以送到這裡的回饋金會被收下並丟棄。`digital` 類型分支是 `UNSUPPORTED`，並且會這樣說明：它的三個欄位只是把 `Barrier.type`、`Barrier.level` 與 `CashOrNothingPayoff.cash_payoff` 再宣告一次，而這些請求本來就帶著了。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:260 0ee5d911fef24186b2e96f47625bad49
msgid ""
"**Compound.** The mother option *is* the option's own `payoff` and "
"`exercise` — `CompoundOption` hands those straight to `OneAssetOption` — "
"so `Compound.mother_payoff` and `Compound.mother_exercise` re-declare "
"fields the request already carries and are `UNSUPPORTED`; send the mother"
" where every other style takes it and put only `daughter_payoff` and "
"`daughter_exercise` in the style block. Both legs are `plain` and "
"European, and the compound has to expire **on or before** the option it "
"is written on."
msgstr "**複合式。**母選擇權*就是*這個選擇權自己的 `payoff` 與 `exercise`——`CompoundOption` 直接把它們交給 `OneAssetOption`——所以 `Compound.mother_payoff` 與 `Compound.mother_exercise` 是在重複宣告請求本來就帶著的欄位，屬於 `UNSUPPORTED`；把母選擇權放在其他每一種類型都用的位置，類型區塊裡只放 `daughter_payoff` 與 `daughter_exercise`。兩腳都是 `plain` 且為歐式，而且複合式的到期日必須**不晚於**它所寫在其上的那個選擇權。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:267 eb65dd3a15fc4fa4ab882f362de1b1c1
msgid ""
"**Chooser.** The strike and the expiry are the option's own `payoff` and "
"`exercise`, for the same reason the compound's mother is — both chooser "
"instruments hand a `PlainVanillaPayoff` and the (call) exercise to "
"`OneAssetOption` — so `Chooser.call_strike` and `Chooser.call_expiry` are"
" `UNSUPPORTED`. Send `payoff.plain.strike` with **`payoff.type` unset**: "
"a chooser has no side until the choice date, and that is the one place in"
" the schema where a set `type` would be read and thrown away. A "
"`put_expiry` in the style block is what makes it the *complex* chooser, "
"with `put_strike` beside it; without one it is the simple chooser, which "
"shares a single strike and expiry, and a `put_strike` alone is "
"`INVALID_ARGUMENT`. `choice_date` must fall after the evaluation date and"
" before every expiry. Three further rules are the engines', not the "
"product's: all three curves must count days the same way (the simple "
"engine requires it, the complex one assumes it unchecked); the exercise "
"must be `EUROPEAN`, since neither engine reads the type and an American "
"one would price as European; and each complex leg must expire more than "
"**twice** the choice time out, because `AnalyticComplexChooserEngine` "
"solves for the critical spot at `maturity - 2 × choice time`. - "
"**Cliquet.** A series of forward starts, so it takes a "
"`percentage_strike` payoff for the same reason one does, plus "
"`reset_dates` — in order, distinct, each on or after the evaluation date "
"and before the expiry. `performance` is a `Flag` and selects the engine, "
"exactly as it does on a forward start: false is `AnalyticCliquetEngine` "
"(the ratchet), true is `AnalyticPerformanceEngine`, and `MONTE_CARLO` "
"reaches `MCPerformanceEngine`, which is the only sampled cliquet engine "
"QuantLib has — a `MONTE_CARLO` ratchet is `UNSUPPORTED` and says so. "
"**`local_cap`, `local_floor`, `global_cap` and `global_floor` are "
"`UNSUPPORTED`**, and not for want of an engine: "
"`CliquetOption::setupArguments` copies the reset dates and nothing else "
"(`cliquetoption.cpp:32`), so a cap would reach no engine at all and the "
"price would be the uncapped ratchet under a capped description. Both "
"closed forms write `results_.gamma += 0.0` — and the performance one does"
" the same to delta — so those come back in `unavailable_results` rather "
"than as a zero nobody computed."
msgstr "**選擇者。**履約價與到期日就是這個選擇權自己的 `payoff` 與 `exercise`，理由和複合式的母選擇權相同——兩種選擇者商品都把一個 `PlainVanillaPayoff` 與（買權的）履約交給 `OneAssetOption`——所以 `Chooser.call_strike` 與 `Chooser.call_expiry` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`。送出 `payoff.plain.strike`，並且**不要設定 `payoff.type`**：選擇者在選擇日之前沒有買賣方向，而這是結構描述中唯一一處，設定了的 `type` 會被讀進來再丟掉的地方。類型區塊中有 `put_expiry`，才使它成為*複雜型*選擇者，旁邊搭配 `put_strike`；沒有的話就是簡單型選擇者，共用單一的履約價與到期日，而單獨送 `put_strike` 則是 `INVALID_ARGUMENT`。`choice_date` 必須落在評價日之後、每一個到期日之前。另外三條規則屬於引擎，而非商品本身：三條曲線必須以相同方式計日（簡單型引擎會檢查，複雜型引擎則不檢查就直接假設）；履約必須是 `EUROPEAN`，因為兩個引擎都不讀型態，美式會被當成歐式計價；而複雜型的每一腳到期日都必須超過選擇時間的**兩倍**，因為 `AnalyticComplexChooserEngine` 是在 `maturity - 2 × choice time` 求解臨界現貨價。 - **棘輪式。**一連串的遠期起始，所以基於同樣的理由吃 `percentage_strike` 收益函數，另外還要 `reset_dates`——依序排列、彼此相異，每一個都不早於評價日且早於到期日。`performance` 是一個 `Flag`，用來選擇引擎，和它在遠期起始上的作用完全一樣：false 是 `AnalyticCliquetEngine`（棘輪型），true 是 `AnalyticPerformanceEngine`，而 `MONTE_CARLO` 會走到 `MCPerformanceEngine`，那是 QuantLib 唯一的抽樣型棘輪引擎——`MONTE_CARLO` 的棘輪型是 `UNSUPPORTED`，並且會這樣說明。**`local_cap`、`local_floor`、`global_cap` 與 `global_floor` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`**，而且並不是因為缺少引擎：`CliquetOption::setupArguments` 只複製重設日，其他什麼都不複製（`cliquetoption.cpp:32`），所以上限根本到不了任何引擎，得到的價格會是掛著有上限描述的無上限棘輪型。兩個封閉解都寫了 `results_.gamma += 0.0`——表現型對 delta 也做了同樣的事——所以這些會出現在 `unavailable_results` 裡，而不是以一個沒人算過的零回傳。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:299 6bfcc59c0fb54813a6fa9851a5385e8d
msgid ""
"**Basket.** The only style that takes more than one underlying, and the "
"only one that names a `correlation` market object. Every underlying needs"
" a **`label`**, because the matrix indexes on labels rather than on "
"position. `ANALYTIC` is two assets and closed-form: `StulzEngine` for "
"`KIND_MIN` and `KIND_MAX`, `KirkEngine` for `KIND_SPREAD` — Kirk is a "
"formula on futures, so the reference rows send `PROCESS_BLACK`. "
"`KIND_AVERAGE` and any third asset take `MONTE_CARLO`. `weights` are read"
" by `AverageBasketPayoff` and by nothing else, so they are `UNSUPPORTED` "
"on the other three kinds rather than taken and dropped. "
"`FINITE_DIFFERENCE` is `UNSUPPORTED`: `Fd2dBlackScholesVanillaEngine` "
"wants two space grids and `FdParameters` describes one. The five greeks "
"`MultiAssetOption` does not declare — `thetaPerDay`, `deltaForward`, "
"`elasticity`, `strikeSensitivity`, `itmCashProbability` — come back named"
" absent."
msgstr "**一籃子。**唯一一個吃超過一個標的的類型，也是唯一一個會指名 `correlation` 市場物件的類型。每個標的都需要一個 **`label`**，因為矩陣是依標籤而非位置索引。`ANALYTIC` 限兩個資產、封閉解：`KIND_MIN` 與 `KIND_MAX` 用 `StulzEngine`，`KIND_SPREAD` 用 `KirkEngine`——Kirk 是一條寫在期貨上的公式，所以參考列送的是 `PROCESS_BLACK`。`KIND_AVERAGE` 以及任何第三個資產都走 `MONTE_CARLO`。`weights` 只有 `AverageBasketPayoff` 會讀，其他都不會，所以在另外三種種類上它是 `UNSUPPORTED`，而不是收下再丟掉。`FINITE_DIFFERENCE` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`：`Fd2dBlackScholesVanillaEngine` 需要兩個空間網格，而 `FdParameters` 只描述一個。`MultiAssetOption` 沒有宣告的五個希臘字母——`thetaPerDay`、`deltaForward`、`elasticity`、`strikeSensitivity`、`itmCashProbability`——會以具名缺席的方式回傳。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:312 621d00b5687a47a89d350d76306d53a1
msgid ""
"**Vanilla.** A binary payoff on an American exercise is a one-touch and "
"goes to `AnalyticDigitalAmericanEngine`. An American `ANALYTIC` price "
"**must** name an approximation (below)."
msgstr "**一般型。**美式履約上的二元收益函數是 one-touch，會走 `AnalyticDigitalAmericanEngine`。美式的 `ANALYTIC` 價格**必須**指名一種近似法（見下文）。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:316 12cea5b042384f94bf6fdc5bd4c2e4fc
msgid ""
"**Payoffs.** Seven build: `plain`, `percentage_strike`, "
"`asset_or_nothing`, `cash_or_nothing`, `gap`, `super_fund`, "
"`super_share`. `floating` is valid on a lookback only, and the two binary"
" payoffs select an engine rather than a formula: on a `vanilla` with an "
"American exercise they give a one-touch, and on a `barrier` a knock "
"digital."
msgstr "**收益函數。**實作了七種：`plain`、`percentage_strike`、`asset_or_nothing`、`cash_or_nothing`、`gap`、`super_fund`、`super_share`。`floating` 只在回顧式上有效，而兩種二元收益函數選的是引擎而不是公式：在美式履約的 `vanilla` 上得到 one-touch，在 `barrier` 上則得到敲出入二元選擇權。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:322 dcabc63f4dc1438bac60443d9f844dc7
msgid ""
"**Exercise.** `EUROPEAN`, `AMERICAN` and `BERMUDAN` all build. "
"`Exercise.dates` carries one date for European and American and every "
"exercise date for Bermudan. `payoff_at_expiry` is a `Flag` read on "
"American and Bermudan only, where it must be set explicitly."
msgstr "**履約。**`EUROPEAN`、`AMERICAN` 與 `BERMUDAN` 都可以建構。`Exercise.dates` 在歐式與美式時帶一個日期，在百慕達式時帶每一個履約日。`payoff_at_expiry` 是一個 `Flag`，只在美式與百慕達式上讀取，而且在這兩者上必須明確設定。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:327 962f5a16f73444b5a2dae60589cc10f7
msgid ""
"**Underlying.** `PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES_MERTON` (the default), "
"`PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES` and `PROCESS_BLACK` build; `GARMAN_KOHLHAGEN`, "
"`HESTON`, `BATES` and `LOCAL_VOL` are `UNSUPPORTED`. "
"`PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES` rejects a `dividend_curve_id` rather than "
"ignoring it. **Omitting `dividend_curve_id` means a flat zero dividend "
"yield**, not the risk-free curve. Exactly one underlying — a second is "
"`INVALID_ARGUMENT` on `instrument.option.underlyings`."
msgstr "**標的。**`PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES_MERTON`（預設）、`PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES` 與 `PROCESS_BLACK` 可以建構；`GARMAN_KOHLHAGEN`、`HESTON`、`BATES` 與 `LOCAL_VOL` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`。`PROCESS_BLACK_SCHOLES` 會拒絕 `dividend_curve_id`，而不是忽略它。**省略 `dividend_curve_id` 代表股利率為平坦的零**，而不是無風險曲線。恰好一個標的——第二個會在 `instrument.option.underlyings` 上得到 `INVALID_ARGUMENT`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:335 85c94902d3f04b7a92dde514de2acaac
msgid ""
"**Quanto** needs all three of `fx_risk_free_curve_id`, `fx_volatility_id`"
" and `correlation_id`, and is not a product: it wraps the *engine*, so it"
" composes over any style whose engine is constructible from a process "
"alone. That is also why a quanto FD path takes only an `engine.fd.preset`"
" — `QuantoEngine` builds its inner engine as "
"`make_shared<Engine>(process)` and leaves no seam for grid sizes, so "
"`engine.fd.custom` is `UNSUPPORTED` there."
msgstr "**Quanto** 需要 `fx_risk_free_curve_id`、`fx_volatility_id` 與 `correlation_id` 三者齊備，而且它不是一種商品：它包裝的是*引擎*，所以能套在任何一種引擎僅憑過程就能建構的類型上。這也是為什麼 quanto 的有限差分路徑只接受 `engine.fd.preset`——`QuantoEngine` 以 `make_shared<Engine>(process)` 建構內部引擎，沒有留下任何可以指定網格大小的接縫，所以 `engine.fd.custom` 在那裡是 `UNSUPPORTED`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:342 2e8a59d4531b47bda31990c8f3af1ae2
msgid "Swap"
msgstr "利率交換"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:344 fd1f6063019c457b8993b3dad5e37e09
msgid ""
"A general n-leg `Swap`. Two of the leg kinds build — `KIND_FIXED` and "
"`KIND_IBOR` — and `engine.method` must be `METHOD_DISCOUNTING`."
msgstr "一般化的 n 腳 `Swap`。交易腳種類中實作了兩種——`KIND_FIXED` 與 `KIND_IBOR`——而 `engine.method` 必須是 `METHOD_DISCOUNTING`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:347 236d2c7e22d24357bdf7c00fc2c298e7
msgid "`pays` is a `Flag` on every leg and must be set."
msgstr "`pays` 是每一腳上的 `Flag`，而且必須設定。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:348 2f80c919d9f9413f998ad6464910ebb8
msgid ""
"`RESULT_KIND_FAIR_RATE` requires exactly two legs, **fixed first, then "
"Ibor**; any other arrangement is `UNSUPPORTED` on `instrument.swap.legs` "
"rather than a fair rate computed off the wrong leg."
msgstr "`RESULT_KIND_FAIR_RATE` 需要恰好兩腳，**先固定、後 Ibor**；任何其他排列都會在 `instrument.swap.legs` 上得到 `UNSUPPORTED`，而不是用錯的那一腳算出一個公平利率。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:351 fe1fbd19c5114d32b78ffeabc069ef8f
msgid ""
"Per-leg `caps`, `floors`, `discount_curve_id` and `currency` are "
"`UNSUPPORTED`."
msgstr "各腳的 `caps`、`floors`、`discount_curve_id` 與 `currency` 是 `UNSUPPORTED`。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:353 84e8b927227f4ae9840ebe4cc3afb1ba
msgid ""
"**A fixed leg freezes its rate.** `FixedRateLeg` takes a value rather "
"than a handle, so `rate_quote_id` is read once at construction; bumping "
"that quote needs a new `PriceRequest`, not an `UpdateMarket`. It is the "
"one place the Handle discipline of DESIGN §5 is knowingly not kept."
msgstr "**固定腳會凍結它的利率。**`FixedRateLeg` 吃的是值而不是控點，所以 `rate_quote_id` 只在建構時讀一次；推動那個報價需要新的 `PriceRequest`，而不是 `UpdateMarket`。這是唯一一處明知而不遵守 DESIGN §5 控點紀律的地方。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:358 94f88f9b878948ceb76895306f0e5eea
msgid "Engines"
msgstr "引擎"

