#: ../../HANDLERS.md 34306fdcb0264b12af047b07d6218c49
msgid ""
"A session is a live QuantLib graph on a worker seat, so this is what "
"protects the pool rather than the socket"
msgstr "一個工作階段就是工作者座位上的一份即時 QuantLib 物件圖，所以這項限制保護的是工作者池，而不是連線"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 65eb2ee531e94500b37d949af5a07982
msgid "frame size"
msgstr "訊框大小"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 29fbcf1853bd4f05b4f485ded886bc6b
