msgstr "網格是相乘的；見[情境掃描](#scenario-sweeps)"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:734 2d3fb6f3ebea47afabfca44287ff2257
msgid ""
"`--max-connections` and `--max-sessions` move the first two. Both are "
"refusals rather than breakages: close a session and the next one opens."
msgstr "`--max-connections` 與 `--max-sessions` 可以調整前兩項。兩者都是拒絕而不是故障：關掉一個工作階段，下一個就開得起來。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:737 8b80cb297d77424f8d2594328bd9a652
msgid ""
"**The token.** `Origin` bets that whoever might abuse the service is a "
"page rather than a process, which is the right bet on a machine with one "
"user on it and the wrong one otherwise. No proxy closes that gap, because"
" a proxy stands beside this service rather than in front of its loopback "
"socket, so the secret has to live here:"
msgstr "**權杖。**`Origin` 押的是：可能濫用服務的是頁面而不是行程。在只有一位使用者的機器上這個賭注押對了，其他情況下就押錯了。沒有任何代理伺服器能補上這個缺口，因為代理伺服器是站在這個服務旁邊，而不是站在它的 loopback socket 前面，所以密鑰必須放在這裡："

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:747 a3ce6a5bb13c4ce69250479522a634d4
msgid ""
"Every client then presents it at the upgrade or is answered `401`, before"
" a socket, a session or a worker seat exists. A file rather than a flag, "
"because arguments are world-readable through `ps` and a token there would"
" be published to exactly the local processes it excludes; refused "
"outright when anyone but its owner can read it."
msgstr "之後每個用戶端都必須在升級時出示它，否則在連線、工作階段或工作者座位存在之前就會得到 `401`。用檔案而不是命令列旗標，是因為參數透過 `ps` 誰都讀得到，權杖放在那裡，等於公開給它原本要擋在外面的那些本機行程；若除了擁有者之外還有人能讀這個檔案，就會被直接拒絕。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md ddbb7585e957405b85d1199bd86fae27
msgid "Client"
msgstr "用戶端"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 5753e84a3a344fcdad5d673de43b59ed
msgid "Where the token goes"
msgstr "權杖放在哪裡"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 0d08f0da608b4a4e80b4cd4fbadee16c
msgid "anything that can set headers"
msgstr "任何能設定標頭的東西"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md c65ab98393fc4337b1f4b2d64e95a056
msgid "`Authorization: Bearer <token>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../HANDLERS.md c8aff25ed9bb43ca92148ced52b29ed5
msgid "a browser"
msgstr "瀏覽器"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md 44ebf90626d84855a4e7e36a8a6ca6ac
msgid "`token.<token>` in the subprotocol list, beside `qlservice.v2`"
msgstr "子協定清單中的 `token.<token>`，放在 `qlservice.v2` 旁邊"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:758 8f5b3a88541b4c009867904cfb226d44
msgid ""
"A browser gets the second row because it cannot set headers: `new "
"WebSocket` takes a URL and a list of subprotocols and nothing else. The "
"service answers with exactly one protocol, never the token, since a "
"browser fails a handshake in which it named protocols and the server "
"selected none. A URL query string would be the third option and is the "
"worst of the three: a URL reaches logs, history and referrers."
msgstr "瀏覽器用第二列，是因為它無法設定標頭：`new WebSocket` 只接受一個 URL 與一份子協定清單，其他什麼都不收。服務只回應恰好一個協定，絕不回應權杖，因為如果瀏覽器指名了協定而伺服器一個都沒選，瀏覽器會讓握手失敗。URL 查詢字串會是第三種做法，也是三者中最糟的：URL 會流進日誌、瀏覽紀錄與 referrer。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:765 99ef2017ac2b4bd7ab4a685c52643fdb
msgid ""
"A wrong token and a missing one are the same `401`, for the reason a "
"refused resume is one answer. The log says which."
msgstr "錯誤的權杖和沒帶權杖都是同樣的 `401`，理由和被拒絕的接回只有一種答案相同。日誌會記下是哪一種。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:768 9fe5437074e64a258a95d151b95aefdc
msgid ""
"**Fail closed on the address.** `--host` anywhere but loopback, with no "
"token, is refused at startup with exit code 2 rather than served. "
"Everything above is a door against a page and none of it is a boundary "
"against the network, so an unauthenticated pricing engine answering a "
"routable address is an accident far more often than a decision."
msgstr "**位址上預設拒絕。**`--host` 設為 loopback 以外的位址卻沒有權杖時，會在啟動時以結束碼 2 拒絕，而不是照常服務。以上一切都是擋頁面的門，沒有一樣是抵擋網路的邊界，所以一個未經驗證、在可路由位址上回應的計價引擎，是意外的機會遠遠大於刻意的決定。"

#: ../../HANDLERS.md:774 b27e34c7ebb14216b0e62986fec97d30
msgid ""
"**What is deliberately not here.** TLS, and users. The token is one "
"shared secret rather than an identity, and anything that can read the "
"token file can present it, so it keeps out another user's process and not"
" one running as that user. If this is ever served off the machine it runs"
" on, a reverse proxy terminates TLS, authenticates and checks origin, and"
" `ql-backend` goes on binding to loopback behind it. A pricing engine "
"that grew its own TLS stack would be a worse pricing engine and a worse "
"edge server."
msgstr "**刻意不放在這裡的東西。**TLS，以及使用者。權杖是一個共用密鑰而不是身分，任何讀得到權杖檔的東西都能出示它，所以它擋得住其他使用者的行程，擋不住以同一位使用者身分執行的行程。如果哪天要在它所執行的機器之外提供服務，就由反向代理終結 TLS、進行驗證並檢查來源，而 `ql-backend` 繼續在它後面綁定 loopback。一個自己長出 TLS 堆疊的計價引擎，會是更差的計價引擎，也是更差的邊緣伺服器。"

